{"version":1,"content":"<p>視后胡定欣視前無綫劇集監製潘嘉德為伯樂，23年前尚未畢業第18期藝員訓練班時，已獲當時任監製的潘嘉德欽點演出經典劇《衝上雲霄》，飾演男主角馬德鐘的妹妹「凌卓芝」，令她嶄露頭角及加入無綫。</p><p>2年後，定欣遇事業低潮，潘嘉德再次邀她演出劇集《酒店風</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:21:03.345514+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T08:18:09.059316+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:18:09.059316+00:00","content_hash":"f71bc06a1d6696ab9a7d088fb0e5011dfba471c8fe51dcf8df1dc4b47f76963b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}